<div class="page-head"><div><h1>AI Settings</h1><p>Konfigurasi Local AI Copilot untuk SCM.</p></div><span class="status-pill ai-setting-status"><i class="bi bi-circle-fill"></i> Local AI</span></div><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-xl-7"><div class="card p-4"><div class="section-title mb-1">Local AI Engine</div><p class="text-muted small">SCM menggunakan Ollama sebagai runtime lokal.</p><div class="settings-row"><div><strong>Runtime</strong><small>Ollama / localhost:11434</small></div><span id="settingsAiStatus" class="badge ai-offline">Checking...</span></div><div class="settings-row"><div><strong>Model</strong><small>Model default untuk Copilot</small></div><select class="form-select form-select-sm w-auto"><option>qwen3:4b</option></select></div><div class="settings-row"><div><strong>Privacy Mode</strong><small>Data procurement diproses lokal.</small></div><span class="status-pill active">Enabled</span></div></div></div><div class="col-xl-5"><div class="card p-4"><div class="section-title">Setup Guide</div><ol class="small text-muted ps-3 mt-3"><li>Install Ollama pada PC/server.</li><li>Jalankan <code>ollama pull qwen3:4b</code>.</li><li>Pastikan port 11434 aktif.</li><li>Buka AI Copilot dari dashboard.</li></ol><a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="README_SCM_AI_SETUP.md">Open AI Guide</a></div></div></div><script>fetch('api/ai.php',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({action:'health',model:'qwen3:4b'})}).then(r=>r.json()).then(d=>{let e=document.getElementById('settingsAiStatus');e.textContent=d.ok?'AI ONLINE':'AI OFFLINE';e.className='badge '+(d.ok?'ai-online':'ai-offline')}).catch(()=>{});</script>
